<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ipmuda stock trading suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ipmuda stock trading suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ipmuda Bhd said on Wednesday it has requested the suspension of trading in its stock pending a news announcement.</p>
<p>A company official declined</p>
<p>to discuss the nature of the announcement, and said it would be released in &quot;due course&quot;. Ipmuda makes and trades building materials.</p>
<p>Its stock rose 40 cents to 6.20 ringgit on Wednesday prior to the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
